  "details": "I've been getting the same video player crash as some people have been having. Since the EAC update. when ANY video (trusted or untrusted url) loads, VRChat crashes. Sometimes the video plays but, when joining a new world, vrchat will crash. all of their problems pointed to having a radeon card. I have a GTX 3070 with an intel chip. still I tried their solution fresh installing drivers and tried rolling back drivers with no avail. I've also tried other common video player fixes like installing visual c++'s, installing and deleting certificates and have windows media feature pack installed. \nthis has really affected me since most worlds have a video player + a url already loaded.\nhttps://pastebin.com/R9ir3tiA",
